          "filename": "SOS Mar Menor 30-10-2019 (182650).jpg",
          "caption": "The \"SOS Mar Menor\" demonstration was summoned in Cartagena (Region of Murcia) on October 30, 2019 as a protest against the environmental deterioration of Mar Menor. It gathered 55,000 people according to the police, who started a march from  Alameda de San Antón to the Regional Assembly building, on Paseo de Alfonso XIII.\nIn the photograph, a protester exhibits a banner showing some of the thousands of fish and living beings dead as a result of the ecological crisis in Mar Menor, as well as an image of the siltated Portmán Bay, the scene of another environmental disaster.",
